  "notes": [
    "fit: yeah bop (90 bpm, C major/A minor) at half time over Get Up (175 bpm, A minor), -2.8% vocal stretch",
    "rap rides the drops the way DnB MCs do; one vocal bar = two DnB bars",
    "bed: Get Up 1-96, its bars 81-88 repeated so the fast-flow section ends on the drop, 89-160, then the outro from 177 (161-176 cut)",
    "chants tease drop 1 (23-32), verse 1 lands on the full drop at 33, song order through the outro chants (105-112), breakdown 113-120, yeah/bop chop build 121-128 into drop 2 at 129, chant reprise at 145, beat-only outro for DJs",
    "stem arrangement on bed-a: verses over drums + bass (melodic layer -6 dB), full beat under hooks, 0 drums-only bar before each hook, melodic layer pumps on the beat",
    "stem arrangement on bed-b: verses over drums + bass (melodic layer -6 dB), full beat under hooks, 0 drums-only bar before each hook, melodic layer pumps on the beat",
    "stem arrangement on bed-c: verses over drums + bass (melodic layer -6 dB), full beat under hooks, 0 drums-only bar before each hook, melodic layer pumps on the beat",
    "stem arrangement on bed-d: verses over drums + bass (melodic layer -6 dB), full beat under hooks, 0 drums-only bar before each hook, melodic layer pumps on the beat",
    "drop at bar 17: 8-bar build on bed-a-drums, bed-a-bass, bed-a-other, riser, impact, 1 beat(s) of silence",
    "drop at bar 129: 8-bar build on bed-c-drums, bed-c-bass, bed-c-other, riser, impact, 1 beat(s) of silence",
    "v2: chant clips +4 dB, melodic layer ducks 8 dB under the vocal (chants were buried under the full drop)",
    "fills: crash 17, crash 57, crash 81, crash 105, crash 129, crash 145, swell into 57, swell into 81, swell into 105, swell into 145",
    "v3: crashes only on the two drops (Get Up has its own cymbals; crashes on chant entries masked the shouts), drums duck 6 dB under the vocal"
  ],
